# Handbook

Before any implementation request, read and follow `docs/AGENTS.md` and
`docs/RULES.md`. Keep the root `AGENTS.md` / `RULES.md` copies identical when
you edit either pair.

Launch the real reviewer agents listed there (product, engineering, QA,
data/ML, research, scrum; plus a statistician for formula changes). Do not
role-play them.

Record every commit in `docs/DEVLOG.md` using the template at the top of
that file. Do not commit or push `ISSUES.md`, `.env`, or Word drafts.
